      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pick one action. The database can reconstruct its human root, agent version, instance, session, task, capability, decision,\npolicy and grade; the API reveals no customer content; the UI shows the chain using existing components and says exactly\nwhether the row was mediated, veto-capable, vendor-attested, observed afterwards, or uncovered.",
      "originalText": "Pick one action. The database can reconstruct its human root, agent version, instance, session, task, capability, decision,\npolicy and grade; the API reveals no customer content; the UI shows the chain using existing components and says exactly\nwhether the row was mediated, veto-capable, vendor-attested, observed afterwards, or uncovered.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
